            <div xml:id="preface">

                <pb facs="0011" n="III" xml:id="pgIII"/>

                <head>Preface</head>
                <p>This volume was prepared under the direct supervision of E. Ralph Perkins,
                    formerly Chief of the Foreign Relations Division, now headed by S. Everett
                    Gleason. The compilers and editors of the volume were John G. Reid, Velma
                    Hastings Cassidy, Ralph R. Goodwin, Herbert A. Fine, the late Gustave A.
                    Nuermberger, and former staff member Francis C. Prescott.</p>
                <p>The technical editing of the volume and the preparation of the index were the
                    responsibility of the Publishing and Reproduction Services Division. These
                    functions were performed by the Historical Editing Section under Elizabeth A.
                    Vary, Chief, and Ouida J. Ward, Assistant Chief.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">William</hi> M. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Franklin</hi>
                    </signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Director, Historical Office</hi>, <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Bureau of Public Affairs</hi>
                    <lb/><dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1967-03-10"><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >March</hi> 10, 1967</date></dateline></closer>


                <xi:include href="preface-a1.xml" xpointer="preface-a1"/>
